\newpage\section{Comparison results of sym-03-01-TP6 vs Sym-pool-1-1,Sym-pool-1-2,Sym-pool-1-3 neg.}

The following figure shows the distribution of RRA score in the comparison sym-03-01-TP6 vs Sym-pool-1-1,Sym-pool-1-2,Sym-pool-1-3 neg., and the RRA scores of 10 genes.

<<echo=FALSE>>=
gstable=read.table('pooled_screen_1_counts_mageck.gene_summary.txt',header=T)
@
%


<<fig=TRUE,echo=FALSE,width=4.5,height=4.5>>=# 
#
# parameters
# Do not modify the variables beginning with "__"

# gstablename='__GENE_SUMMARY_FILE__'
startindex=75
# outputfile='__OUTPUT_FILE__'
targetgenelist=c("RAN","SNHG16","EIF4A1","TMSB4X","RPS29","RAD51","KRT8","HNRNPA1","RPLP1","DDX5")
# samplelabel=sub('.\w+.\w+$','',colnames(gstable)[startindex]);
samplelabel='sym-03-01-TP6_vs_Sym-pool-1-1,Sym-pool-1-2,Sym-pool-1-3 neg.'


# You need to write some codes in front of this code:
# gstable=read.table(gstablename,header=T)
# pdf(file=outputfile,width=6,height=6)


# set up color using RColorBrewer
#library(RColorBrewer)
